@startuml 03f-theory
' 图 03F：Lean/RFC 四投影理论 ↔ observability EventSpine 工程映射。

skinparam backgroundColor #FCFAF7
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

title 图 03F · 四读角工程映射 ↔ Lean/RFC 理论参照（EventSpine 定锚）
caption <color:#6E6963>定锚：dependency/resource/communication/coordination-structure 四工程读角描绘同一 commit 链；runtime 驱动 · observability 只读。抽象 03H。</color>

top to bottom direction

rectangle "理论层 · Lean / RFC-0002" #EDE8F0 {
  card "CantiluneGraph (C,R)\n协调世界 + rewrite 规则" as T0
  card "源 rewrite 步\nDPOEvent / Config_n → Config_{n+1}" as T0b
  card "P_i : (C,R) → Target_i\n四形式主义 = 四读角" as T1
  card "ProjectionCertificate\nsound · reflect · terminal_iff" as T2
  card "Cross-projection event consistency\n同一源事件 · 四目标推导 · 同 event-tag" as T3
}

rectangle "工程 · @cantilune/core\n协调世界本体" #E5EDE5 {
  card "CollaborationSnapshot ≈ Config σ" as C0
  card "CoordinationChange ≈ DPOEvent" as C1
  card "RunHistory ≈ 轨迹" as C2
  card "Link · Capability · Session\n≈ edges · resources · names" as C3
}

rectangle "工程 · @cantilune/runtime\n运行驱动" #E5ECEE {
  card "commit 链\nbeforeRef → afterRef" as R0
  card "ChangeLog + RunHistoryTracker" as R1
}

rectangle "工程 · @cantilune/observability\n四角度描绘（只读）" #DDE8F0 {
  card "ObservationWorld\n终端 CollaborationSnapshot（core 实体权威）" as O0
  card "EventSpine / SourceEvent\nEventTag + CoordinationChange" as O1
  card "deriveEventSlice → ProjectionSlice\nDelta 字段 = core Link/Capability/Session/Diagnostic" as O2
  card "foldFourViews → FourViewBundle\nView 终态 = snapshot 字段 + byEvent 索引" as O3
  card "CrossViewInvariants\n≈ 四读角 event-tag 一致门控" as O4
  card "ReadModelDerivationEvidence\n≈ 工程自检（非形式化证书）" as O5
}

rectangle "验证 · @cantilune/conformance" #F5F1EB {
  card "批量证书验证 · ReleaseGate" as Conf
}

T0 --> T0b
T0b --> T1
T1 --> T2
T0b --> T3

C0 --> O0
C1 --> O1
C2 --> O0
C3 --> O0
R0 --> O0
R1 --> O0

T0b ..> O1 : 源事件
T1 ..> O2 : 四 functor 单步
T3 ..> O4 : 跨投影一致
T2 ..> O5

O0 --> O1
O1 --> O2
O2 --> O3
O4 --> O3
O5 --> Conf
O3 ..> Conf

note right of O2
  <b>工程≠四硬拼模块</b>
  理论：四 functor 读同一 Change
  工程：EventSpine 中轴
  + 四 lens 产 Delta
  + fold 产 View
end note

note right of R0
  runtime 驱动改写
  observability 不证明定理
  只 derive + 出厂 invariants
  定理/conformance 外置验证
end note

note bottom of O3
  四工程读角（非硬拼四形式主义模块）
  dependency ← Link 依赖边
  resource ← Capability 资源
  communication ← Session 会话
  coordination-structure ← 结构诊断/组合
  理论参照：P_DAG / P_Petri / P_π / P_Mor（conformance 外置）
end note

footer naming-contract §3.4 §7 · runtime 02F · core derive 仅 O5 压缩源

@enduml
